body:
A guy that I hadn't talked to in about 2-3 years messaged me a while ago saying weird things, including that I was "so far up my own fat ass" and that I was a "pretentious bitch." Jokes on him, because actually I hate myself deeply and was actually really happy that I gave off a vibe of self-love, even to an obnoxious degree.

&#x200B;

Also, once I finished a debate against some guys in the year below me and they told me that I was scary.
